      source/world_osm_water.json, source/world_geography.json,
      game/assets/world_geography.json, game/assets/city_map.json and the
      OSM-derived coordinate records in game/assets/darling_square_frontages.json.
      © OpenStreetMap contributors. These files are a Derivative Database and
      remain available under ODbL 1.0; you may use, share and adapt them under
      those terms, including commercially, subject to ODbL's attribution and
      share-alike conditions. Section 3 does not and cannot restrict them.
   c. OurAirports data — public domain.

   See licenses/ASSET_REGISTER.md and licenses/GEOGRAPHY.md for the full
